      "note": "Ladakh did not exist as a separate unit in 2011. Stated as Leh 133,487 plus Kargil 140,802. Corroborated to the nearest thousand; confirm the two district figures against the Census 2011 primary census abstract for Jammu & Kashmir to pin the exact digits."
    },
    "derived_jk": {
