      "confirmed_by": "RGI Technical Group report, TABLE-21, base year 2011, lists Jammu & Kashmir (UT) at 12,267 thousand, matching our 12,267,013.",
      "note": "Residual Jammu & Kashmir. Derived as undivided Jammu & Kashmir 12,541,302 minus Ladakh 274,289. Note that the RGI report already treats J&K and Ladakh as separate units in its 2011 base year, so the split itself is official, not our construction."
    },
    "derived_dh": {
